"""
BM23-TOOLZ :: "Hotmail Checker" — hacker-aesthetic popup notification system.

Dark cyberpunk popup notifications, pure PyQt6 + stdlib.
Import-safe: no QApplication is created and no widget is shown at import time.

Usage
-----
    BM23PopupManager.show("HIT FOUND", "user@hotmail.com : valid", kind="hit")

    BM23PopupManager.show("HIT FOUND", "user@hotmail.com : valid", kind="hit")
    BM23PopupManager.show("JACKPOT", "Home-country hit detected!", kind="epic")
    BM23PopupManager.show("PROXY DEAD", "10.0.0.1:8080 timeout", kind="error")
    BM23PopupManager.show("SCAN STARTED", "Loading combo list...", kind="info")

Brand palette
-------------
    near-black  #05070f
    neon green  #22ff88
    cyan        #67e8f9
    magenta     #ff2bd6
    amber       #ffb020
"""


