# =====================================================================
# v2.15.5 — MAILBOX RECLAMATION REACTOR main GUI.
# Vertical-rail + 3-row-stack layout. Completely different geometry and
# palette from the legacy _21_49e051 checker window AND from the earlier
# Bloomberg terminal experiments. Pale mint on charcoal, JetBrains Mono.
#
# INITIATE wires the REAL _07_b89bdf checker thread — same worker the
# legacy window uses. No demo pipeline, no simulated data, ever.
#
# Per-row double-click hands the FULL account dict to the REAL mailbox
# viewer _0a_4240fa (untouched). The right inspector pane surfaces the
# selected row's info dict live.
