# =====================================================================
# BM23 · TG INGEST — heartbeat-driven bolt-on (Files-tab only).
#   MANUAL mode: new hit → popup with LOAD NOW.
#   AUTO mode : hits feed straight into SIFT queue; auto-INITIATE if idle.
#   Menu: Telegram → Open TG INGEST panel  (Ctrl+G)
# Requires bm23_tg_ingest.py alongside this file.
